  "slug": "my-father",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1401_my-father.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "This is my dad. He is 55 years old. He is a teacher at a university in Sichuan and works Monday through Friday. He goes to school at eight in the morning and comes home at six in the evening. After dinner, he likes to drink tea, and he goes to bed at ten. That’s a typical day for him."
  ],
  "english_full": "This is my dad. He is 55 years old. He is a teacher at a university in Sichuan and works Monday through Friday. He goes to school at eight in the morning and comes home at six in the evening. After dinner, he likes to drink tea, and he goes to bed at ten. That’s a typical day for him.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Э́то мой па́па. Е́му 55 лет. Он наста́вник в университете в Сычуа́не и рабо́тает с понеде́льника по пятни́цу. Он и́дет в шко́лу в во́семь у́тра и приходи́т до́ма в ше́сть ве́чера. По́сле обе́да он подо́бный пить чай и ложи́тся спа́ть в деся́ть. Э́то типи́чный день для него́."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Éto moy pápa. Yému 55 lét. On nástavnik v uníversitete v Sychuánye i rábotayet s ponedél'nik po pyát'nitsu. On ídęt v shkólu v vôsem' útra i prikhodít domóy v shést' večéra. Pósle obédá on podróbny pít' cháy i lózhitsya spát' v dyésyat'. Éto típichnyy dzeń dlya negó."
  ],
